                              "fill": "$a2-ink",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "3. 如果执行失败，会发生什么？",
                              "lineHeight": 1.5,
                              "fontFamily": "Noto Serif SC",
                              "fontSize": 20,
                              "fontWeight": "600"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "fOv3O",
                              "name": "失败处理",
                              "fill": "$a2-ink",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "当工具返回“没有找到这座城市”，模型不能把失败当作天气结果。它需要检查参数、核对城市名称，或者向用户追问更明确的位置。",
                              "lineHeight": 1.75,
                              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                              "fontSize": 16,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "yInlt",
                              "name": "循环判断",
                              "fill": "$a2-ink",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "这也是工具调用需要反复判断的原因。模型先观察已经拿到的结果，再决定是否继续查询、换一种工具，或结束本次请求。每一轮都应有明确的停止条件。",
                              "lineHeight": 1.75,
                              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                              "fontSize": 16,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "z8tNts",
                              "name": "延续小标题",
                              "fill": "$a2-ink",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "4. 从一次调用，到完整的工作流",
                              "lineHeight": 1.5,
                              "fontFamily": "Noto Serif SC",
                              "fontSize": 20,
                              "fontWeight": "600"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "o0FDo",
                              "name": "完整流程",
                              "fill": "$a2-ink",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "真实任务通常不止一个步骤。规划行程时，可能先查天气，再查路线与开放时间；读取代码时，可能先定位文件，再查看实现与测试。工具结果连接起来，才构成用户需要的完整答案。",
                              "lineHeight": 1.75,
                              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                              "fontSize": 16,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "yAuJi",
                              "name": "边界约束",
                              "fill": "$a2-ink",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "工具能做什么，取决于调用方实际提供的能力。只读查询、修改文件和发送消息具有不同后果，执行前需要检查参数、权限与当前任务的范围。",
                              "lineHeight": 1.75,
                              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                              "fontSize": 16,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
