                                      "fontSize": 12,
                                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "id": "o1ZcPd",
                                      "name": "请求参数",
                                      "fill": "$a2-ink",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "content": "get_weather({ city: \"上海\", date: \"今天\" })\n→ { temperature: 24, condition: \"多云\" }",
                                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                                      "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
                                      "fontSize": 14,
                                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "gVOlt",
                                  "name": "小标题",
                                  "fill": "$a2-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "2. 工具结果仍然需要理解",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif SC",
                                  "fontSize": 20,
                                  "fontWeight": "600"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "B1D83",
                                  "name": "结果解释",
                                  "fill": "$a2-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "工具返回的是数据，不一定是用户能直接使用的答案。模型还要检查结果是否完整，再结合问题解释温度、天气以及出行建议。",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                                  "fontSize": 16,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "UcCrY",
                                  "name": "判断边界",
                                  "fill": "$a2-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "例如，用户问“今天适合散步吗”，只返回 24℃ 还不够。模型可能继续查询降雨概率，也可能先追问用户所在的城市。",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                                  "fontSize": 16,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "wXmdN",
                                  "name": "小标题",
                                  "fill": "$a2-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "3. 如果执行失败，会发生什么？",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif SC",
                                  "fontSize": 20,
                                  "fontWeight": "600"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "u361mL",
                                  "name": "失败处理",
                                  "fill": "$a2-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "当工具返回“没有找到这座城市”，模型不能把失败当作天气结果。它需要检查参数、核对城市名称，或者向用户追问更明确的位置。",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                                  "fontSize": 16,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "VN793",
                                  "name": "循环判断",
                                  "fill": "$a2-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "这也是工具调用需要反复判断的原因。模型先观察已经拿到的结果，再决定是否继续查询、换一种工具，或结束本次请求。每一轮都应有明确的停止条件。",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                                  "fontSize": 16,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "K73mG",
                                  "name": "延续小标题",
                                  "fill": "$a2-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "4. 从一次调用，到完整的工作流",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif SC",
                                  "fontSize": 20,
                                  "fontWeight": "600"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "XlPEL",
                                  "name": "完整流程",
                                  "fill": "$a2-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "真实任务通常不止一个步骤。规划行程时，可能先查天气，再查路线与开放时间；读取代码时，可能先定位文件，再查看实现与测试。工具结果连接起来，才构成用户需要的完整答案。",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                                  "fontSize": 16,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "crHuq",
                                  "name": "边界约束",
                                  "fill": "$a2-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "工具能做什么，取决于调用方实际提供的能力。只读查询、修改文件和发送消息具有不同后果，执行前需要检查参数、权限与当前任务的范围。",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                                  "fontSize": 16,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "pnJn0",
                                  "name": "延续小标题",
                                  "fill": "$a2-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "小结：用一条链解释工具调用",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif SC",
                                  "fontSize": 20,
                                  "fontWeight": "600"
                                },
