                                  "name": "结果解释",
                                  "fill": "$a2d-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "工具返回的是数据，不一定是用户能直接使用的答案。模型还要检查结果是否完整，再结合问题解释温度、天气以及出行建议。",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                                  "fontSize": 16,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "NCC4n",
                                  "name": "判断边界",
                                  "fill": "$a2d-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "例如，用户问“今天适合散步吗”，只返回 24℃ 还不够。模型可能继续查询降雨概率，也可能先追问用户所在的城市。",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                                  "fontSize": 16,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "MNArX",
                                  "name": "小标题",
                                  "fill": "$a2d-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "3. 如果执行失败，会发生什么？",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif SC",
                                  "fontSize": 20,
                                  "fontWeight": "600"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "IvH21",
                                  "name": "失败处理",
                                  "fill": "$a2d-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "当工具返回“没有找到这座城市”，模型不能把失败当作天气结果。它需要检查参数、核对城市名称，或者向用户追问更明确的位置。",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                                  "fontSize": 16,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "LyMGQ",
                                  "name": "循环判断",
                                  "fill": "$a2d-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "这也是工具调用需要反复判断的原因。模型先观察已经拿到的结果，再决定是否继续查询、换一种工具，或结束本次请求。每一轮都应有明确的停止条件。",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                                  "fontSize": 16,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "ikdo0",
                                  "name": "延续小标题",
                                  "fill": "$a2d-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "4. 从一次调用，到完整的工作流",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif SC",
                                  "fontSize": 20,
                                  "fontWeight": "600"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "sgkRg",
                                  "name": "完整流程",
                                  "fill": "$a2d-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "真实任务通常不止一个步骤。规划行程时，可能先查天气，再查路线与开放时间；读取代码时，可能先定位文件，再查看实现与测试。工具结果连接起来，才构成用户需要的完整答案。",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                                  "fontSize": 16,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
